  "term": "DAS",
  "definition": "DAS, in this context, stands for Dog-Assisted Services: informal, motivational interactions involving a dog in a helping role, but without specific therapeutic goals. It is described as one form of dog-assisted intervention aimed at supporting people’s health, educational, or psychosocial wellbeing.",
